OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBrightening up, after a cloudy
OL,6,Fand damp start to the day, with sunny
OL,7,Fspells and a scattering of showers
OL,8,Finto the afternoon. The showers
OL,9,Fheaviest and most frequent in the
OL,10,Fnorth. Breezier than of late and
OL,11,Ffeeling cooler.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers continue overnight
OL,14,Fwhich will stay heavy for some, and
OL,15,Fpossibly isolated thunder. Light winds
OL,16,Fbut gusty in and around heavy showers.
OL,17,FFeeling fresher and less humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
