OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FMorning showers move
OL,6,Feastwards through the morning but
OL,7,Freturn in the afternoon. Heavy and
OL,8,Fthundery into the evening with the mix
OL,9,Fof hail. Temperatures around or just
OL,10,Fbelow average.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,13,Fnortherly wind develops for the next
OL,14,Ffew days, allowing temperatures to
OL,15,Fdrop below average. Thunder showers
OL,16,Ffor Thursday and Friday, but brighter
OL,17,Fand drier for Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
